--- a/src/core/task-intent.ts
+++ b/src/core/task-intent.ts
@@ -171,0 +172 @@
+The candidate is a FINAL response, not a progress update. Accepting it stops the agent immediately. Promises to read, edit or submit later do not execute anything; a draft in prose is not an operation receipt. If the user requested a revision for review, require a real proposal receipt or a supported explanation that no change is needed. Advice-only requests can finish with an answer and must not be forced into a write. Evaluate the actual outcome, independently from whether the candidate's wording is polite or plausible.
